+        // Code-sweep finding R1 (basis inferred): 0.6.0 built a link-free `new/../new` under
+        // `All`; a release semver-compatible with 0.6.0 (any 0.6.x) must not start refusing it.
+        // Either the behavior or the version (0.7.0) answers this; the test asserts only that the
